{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2023-03", "window": 2, "start_date": 1678233600, "end_date": 1678924799, "month_true_total": 51, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:22:09 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "134678856", "author": {"steamid": "76561198162780310", "personaname": "Talus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/TalarFracture/", "num_games_owned": 171, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 669, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 668, "last_played": 1678842156, "avatar": "827861d0f59acd87a6acb9b5f24fa3c686cc0eb3"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is good, but it's buggy and crashes a lot, I really hope they remake it.", "timestamp_created": 1678842065, "timestamp_updated": 1678842065, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "134674587", "author": {"steamid": "76561198296371641", "personaname": "rufus_mcgayhee", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198296371641/", "num_games_owned": 996, "num_reviews": 260, "playtime_forever": 839, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 244, "last_played": 1680620404, "avatar": "31a5a0862d75af78f7de2ce5469ebf24c2c97070"}, "language": "english", "review": "Man, I played Risk of Rain 2 for a bit and then one day decided to give this a shot.  \n\nIts really the exact same game but sideways!  All the things the enemies do in 2 are seen here in their seminal debut!  This is a really fun and addicting roguelike.  I like to play with the keyboard.  Its old school... no mouse will be used.  I go back and forth in between 1 and 2 now because they both offer a similar experience filtered through a completely different lens.  \n\nThis game debuted around the age of Terraria and Minecraft.  So it was taking the roguelike formula and applying it to the trends at the moment.  They definitely hit a hot spot!  The gameplay works very well and the sprites are so fun and the artstyle is impeccable.  No run is ever the same and I wholeheartedly mean that.  I really enjoy this game and recommend it to any fans of rogues and roguelikes.  \n\nEasy 9/10", "timestamp_created": 1678834420, "timestamp_updated": 1678834462, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "134605912", "author": {"steamid": "76561199477424925", "personaname": "EyeOfDurt", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199477424925/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1463, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 827, "last_played": 1693553810, "avatar": "9a616d7e5772d706f394b456d4ec3a2d6c0af1fa"}, "language": "english", "review": "over the years i cant imagine how many hours ive put into this title.. glad to play it again, it just has nearly endless replayibility", "timestamp_created": 1678724747, "timestamp_updated": 1678724747, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "134589245", "author": {"steamid": "76561198879233239", "personaname": "Dave", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/davethemagicinflationmoth/", "num_games_owned"